4
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:21,190
Every year after Christmas or well during the Christmas holidays, we talk about New Years, New Years Day and a very important topic, New Years Resolutions.

5
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:24,730
Alright, so we're not going to preview anything today.

6
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:31,790
