Your gym bag is gathering dust and you still have brand new running shoes that are yet to be jogged in.

22
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:31,640
Well I would go if you kept your promise of going to the gym with me every day.

23
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:33,080
Yeah, yeah, whatever.

24
00:01:38,690 --> 00:01:39,870
Alright, great, we're back.

25
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,440
So this is very typical.

26
00:01:41,670 --> 00:01:46,310
A New Year's resolution that you make but then people don't really stick to it, etc.

27
00:01:46,570 --> 00:01:46,990
They don't?

28
00:01:47,770 --> 00:01:48,650
